The progressive queries first explore the relevant CCRCC RNA-Seq and proteomics samples, identify overlapping aliquot / barcode IDs, assemble paired measurements, calculate gene-level Pearson correlations within each sample type, retain only strong associations (|r| > 0.5), and finally compute the mean correlation for “Primary Tumor” and “Solid Tissue Normal” samples.
